---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms & Conditions | My Learning Studio"
  description="The tutoring agreement between My Learning Studio, parents, and students: responsibilities, payment policies, and attendance policies."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="the fine print"
    title="Terms & Conditions"
    lead="This agreement is between My Learning Studio and My Learning Studio OUTREACH (hereinafter MLS), parent and student. Should either party be unwilling or unable to meet the responsibilities outlined below, MLS reserves the right to terminate said agreement."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container terms" style="max-width: 820px;">
      <h2>Emergency Medical Release</h2>
      <p>
        I understand that in case of emergency requiring medical treatment for
        my child, I may not be available for consent and that treatment may be
        withheld without my prior consent. Therefore, in case of injury to my
        child while attending a My Learning Studio activity, I give advance
        authorization to My Learning Studio to provide medical treatment by any
        licensed physician, nurse, EMT, or hospital to render such treatment to
        my child as they may deem necessary, and I will be held responsible for
        any cost or fees arising thereof.
      </p>

      <h2>Student's Responsibilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Attend all scheduled tutoring sessions and participate actively in each session (ask questions, complete practice problems, etc.).</li>
        <li>Arrive on time, but no more than 10 minutes early, to scheduled tutoring sessions.</li>
        <li>Bring all academic support materials to each tutoring session (textbooks, homework, workbooks if applicable).</li>
        <li>Prepare for each session by reviewing what needs to be covered and sharing that information with the tutor.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Solicitation of Tutors</h2>
      <p>
        Parent and student shall not solicit individual MLS tutors for
        individual tutoring or personal contact such as phone number, social
        media, or email. Parent and student agree that violation of this
        condition will result in the immediate termination of tutoring services
        without refund.
      </p>

      <h2>Non-Disclosure Clause</h2>
      <p>
        Parent and student agree not to disclose to any other party, company,
        person or entity the trade secrets, working or tutoring policies and
        workmanship of MLS. Parent and student agree that violation of this
        condition will result in the immediate termination of tutoring services
        without refund.
      </p>

      <h2>Administration of Tutors</h2>
      <p>
        MLS reserves the right to choose and change the appropriate tutor for
        the student based on the student's needs, tutors' and/or MLS'
        availability and scheduling.
      </p>

      <h2>Parents</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Consultation with tutors is within your own time slot (55 minutes typically).</li>
        <li>Parents need not be present during tutoring, and it is recommended that the student work independently with the tutor during the session.</li>
        <li>Parent/guardian must be punctual at time of pick-up after sessions.</li>
        <li>Late starts due to tardiness do not mean late endings of the tutoring session. Early arrival does not mean an early ending to the tutoring session.</li>
        <li>Students are not to be dropped off more than 10 minutes early and must be picked up within 10 minutes of ending time. Otherwise, an additional fee will be incurred at $1.00 per minute thereafter.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Payment Policies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Parent/guardian is purchasing a Yearly Family Registration Fee, which includes those students in the same household. This fee is due on or before their anniversary date, unless a week's worth of reserve sessions are in deposit.</li>
        <li>Parent/guardian and student are agreeing to purchase a deposit of one week's worth of sessions and hold it as a deposit, referred to as Reserve Sessions. This deposit is held until tutoring is no longer needed and will be used for the last week of tutoring. Any unused reserve sessions expire after one year of non-activity and are not transferable.</li>
        <li>Payment is due each and every Friday for scheduled tutoring sessions for that week (Sunday-Saturday) that are outstanding. The deposit will be used when the parent/guardian informs MLS beyond 36 hours to use these sessions instead of paying on Friday. A session is a predesignated timeframe between MLS and the parents, such as 55 minutes.</li>
        <li>Failed payments will receive a warning for the first time, a $15 service fee for the second time, and a $25 service fee for three or more failed payments. You will be removed from the schedule and not guaranteed the same tutor upon return if the balance is not paid.</li>
        <li>It is not the responsibility of MLS to contact you regarding your payment. Reminder calls and emails are considered a courtesy, not a requirement.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Attendance Policies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Absences must be pre-approved by MLS 36 hours prior to the tutoring session. If MLS is not notified within 36 hours (1 1/2 days) of the designated time frame, tutoring lessons/sessions will not be reimbursed or rescheduled.</li>
        <li>If more than 36 hours' notice is given, MLS will reschedule up to one (1) session per 6-week/12-session block within the 6-week/12-session timeframe. No refunds will be granted, no exceptions.</li>
        <li>In the event a reschedule is not possible, 1 extension per 12-session block is allowed, only for absences pre-approved 36 hours in advance.</li>
        <li>If minimum enrollments are not met, classes are canceled.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Family Registration Fee</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Family Registration must be paid in full before services begin. This Family Registration covers those residing in the same household.</li>
        <li>Registration fees are renewed every year on the anniversary date, unless a week's worth of reserve sessions are on deposit in your account.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="callout">
        <p>This policy is effective upon registration and does not expire.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .terms h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .terms li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
</style>
